  "_note": "Remote MCP services Nexus can sign in to with no per-service setup. Keys are lowercase provider names. Checked 2026-10-07 (docs/launch-services.md). Add a service by adding a row here and a catalog entry in src/store.ts. \"scope\" names the argument a service's tools use for one resource so a binding can be limited to it; verified:false means it comes from docs and has not been checked against a live sign-in (a wrong name only makes the limit refuse more, never leak).",
